Parts of the terminal painter follow herdr-gpui
(https://github.com/penso/herdr-gpui), Copyright the herdr-gpui authors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- painting glyphs with Window::paint_glyph inside Window::paint_layer instead
  of ShapedLine::paint;
- merging equal backgrounds within a row into one quad;
- drawing box-drawing and block characters as rectangles snapped to the grid;
- the approach of the performance harness.

The bindings in crates/ghostty-vt/src/ffi.rs are generated from the headers of
libghostty-vt (https://github.com/ghostty-org/ghostty), MIT licensed.
